# .NET build output
bin/
obj/

# Environment secrets
.env

# Editor / IDE
.vs/

# /run failure screenshots (debugging artifacts, not source)
/Screenshots/

# TheInternetHerokuappComLoginPage (the-internet.herokuapp.com/login) is the
# one exception: Demo.Tests compiles it, and its .Custom.cs holds a
# hand-written method that can't be regenerated. Everything else
# (WwwEmagRoPage, IqcenterComIqPage, ...) is always reproducible by running
# the generator again, so it doesn't need to live in git.
/GeneratedPages/*
!/GeneratedPages/TheInternetHerokuappComLoginPage.cs
!/GeneratedPages/TheInternetHerokuappComLoginPage.Custom.cs
!/GeneratedPages/TheInternetHerokuappComLoginPage.meta.json
!/GeneratedPages/TheInternetHerokuappComLoginPageTests.cs